          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "في الوقت نفسه — fī al-waqt nafsih — \"at the same time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تطبخ أمي وتتكلم في الهاتف في الوقت نفسه. taṭbukhu ummī wa-tatakallamu fī al-hātif fī al-waqt nafsih. My mother cooks and talks on the phone at the same time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "في الوقت نفسه (fī al-waqt nafsih) is \"in the time itself\": waqt is built on the native Arabic root w-q-t (Lane), and nafs, \"self, soul\", on n-f-s."
            }
          ]
        },
