            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حالما وصلت اتصلت بأمي. ḥālamā waṣaltu ittaṣaltu bi-ummī. As soon as I arrived I called my mother."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A past verb follows it in a story."
